# basic_sweep.scenario
ADD BUY 100 10       # ADD <SIDE> <PRICE> <QTY>
ADD BUY 101 10
ADD BUY 102 10
ADD SELL 100 25      # Sweeps 102, 101, and partially fills 100

EXPECT TRADE 4 3 102 10 # EXPECT TRADE <AGG_ID> <PASSIVE_ID> <PRICE> <QTY>
EXPECT TRADE 4 2 101 10
EXPECT TRADE 4 1 100 5

EXPECT BOOK BID 100 5   # EXPECT BOOK <SIDE> <PRICE> <QTY>
EXPECT BOOK ASK EMPTY
